        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Enkibookinoto e nkop oo laisinak",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nedumunye apa olkiyioi kitok loo ltung'ana o nkituaak enye, te nkaraki Ilyahudi alashera lenye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu etii apa lelo oojo, “Ore iyiook tenebo ilayiok lang o ntoyie ang naa eikira kumok, maing'oru iyiook entapa pee kitum aainosa nikinchu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eetae sii apa lelo oojo, “Kiteena te sile nkurman ang, o nkurman ang oo sabibu o nkajijik ang, pee kitum entapa te nkaraki olameyu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Netii sii lelo oojo, “Kisilenoitie mpisai te kodi o laiguanani te nkaraki nkurman ang o nkurman ang oo sabibu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Etotiutuo taata iseseni lang anaa iseseni loo lalashera lang; netotiutuo nkera ang anaa nkera enye; eji neton ake kirrumoki ilayiok lang o ntoyie ang metaa rrindiki; ore kulie oo ntoyie ang neidipaki aaitaa rrindiki; amu mikiaata engolon nikiretunye. Amu ewaita kulikae tung'ana nkurman ang o nkurman ang o sabibu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.5.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atagore apa oleng pee aning olkiyioi lenye o kulo rorei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.22.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ena 22.25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.25.35+LEV.25.36+LEV.25.37"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ilaw 25.35-37",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.23.19+DEU.23.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enkig 23.19-20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Aiguane nanu makewan, nadung'oki enkiguana lelo kituaak o larikok. Najoki nanu ninche, “Ntulusoitie elaakinoto e dupoto o ltung'ani ake olalashe lenye.” Naibung ina umata kitok agilunore ninche, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "najoki ninche, “Ore iyiook anaa enikindim nikinyiang'utua aarrinyu ilyahudi alashera lang apa ootimirakaki iloreren; kake eji imir iyie ilalashera linono eji pee etumi aatimiraki iyiook!” Etigirate ninche neitu etum ororei owalu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaae najo nanu, “Ore ina bae niaasitata intae neme sidai. Aimeishiaakino intae nipuopuo te uriata e Nkai ang, pee imbooyoyo nkinyalat e lelo oshon mang'ati lang? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ake sii nanu o lalashera laainei nikisilenoki ninche mpisai o entapa. Matung'uai iyiook ena dupoto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Entorrinyoki ninche ena olong taata nkurman enye, o nkurman enye oo sabibu, o nkurman enye oo loirienito, o nkajijik enye, o maaip oo ropiyiani enye, o entapa, o enaisho oo sabibu o ina ilata apa niwaita aaitung'uaa ninche.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki ninche aajo, “Eikirrinyu iyiook kuna nimikinkilikuanu toki te ninche. Eikiaas iyiook anaa enijo.” Naipotu nanu ilapolosak nainosie ninche olmumai pee eas anaa enaisiligishore. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naitoki sii aipirripir enkila ai, najo, “Meikuna neijia Enkai aipiripiroo pooki tung'ani te nkaji enye, o te siaai enye tenemeitabaya ena kisiligata. Meipiripiri ninye neitoroki.” Nejo eumata pooki, “Esai” Neisis Olaitoriani. Neas lelo tung'ana aanaa enaisiligishore ninche.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.5.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mme olayioni le kewan Nehemia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ake sii ebaiki ina kata apa naageluni mataa olbalusui te nkop e Yuda, ebaiki olari le tikitam o metabaiki olari le tomoni uni o are le nkitoria e Arteserses ilo aiguanani, ilarin tomon o are, eitu nanu o lalashera laainei aainos ina daa o lbalusui. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore lelo balusuni apa le dukuya ootii te dukuya nanu neitanap iltung'ana ilolan ooiroishi, neoru ninche endaa o enaisho oo sabibu, metii shekeli artam e nkosholai. Neitore sii isinkan lenye olorere. Kake eitu nanu aas ina, te nkaraki euriata e Nkai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aibung'a sii apa enchetata ena suntai, neitu aing'oru enkop. Ore isinkan laainei pooki neiturrurro teine tenkaraki esiaai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ake sii etii apa emisa ai iltung'ana iip nabo o onom, Ilyahudi o lkituaak metii lelo apa ooetuo enikitii eing'uaa lelo oreren oomanita iyiook. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.5.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore apa endaa naitobiri te nkolong nabo naa olkiteng obo o nkerra ile gelunot; eitobiraki sii apa ilukunkuni te nkaraki nanu. Ore ake too nkolong'i tomon netii ilbenia le naisho oo sabibu te nkumoi; ore ake etii kuna pooki eitu nanu aikilikuanu endaa naipirare olbalusui, amu keiroishi apa esinkaisho te kulo tung'ana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.5.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tadamu te nkaraki esupatisho tialo nanu na Ai ai, nena pooki nataasa te nkaraki kulo tung'ana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.5.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
